# Build context exclusions. No Dockerfile COPYs anything below; keeping them out
# shrinks every image build's context and keeps host virtualenvs out of images.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
*.env
**/*openrc*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
kubeconfig
.kube
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
docker-compose.override.yml
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
.vscode
.claude
latex
export
experiments
docs
data
examples

# setuptools output from a host `pip install ./shared`: setuptools copies sources over an
# existing build/lib but never removes files deleted from the sources, so images could ship them.
**/build
**/*.egg-info
